'''Pesthunter Phillip''' is an [[NPC]] that acts as a guide for [[Pest]]s in {{zone|The Garden}}. They spawn upon reaching {{Skill|Garden|5}}.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}
== Usage ==
=== Bonus Farming Fortune ===
Pesthunter Phillip will give the player bonus {{stat|Farming Fortune}} for {{Green|30 minutes}} ({{Green|60 minutes}} with {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}}'s Pest Eradicator perk active) upon receiving pests from a vacuum. The bonus is {{stat|Farming Fortune|5}} per pest, up to a maximum of {{stat|Farming Fortune|200}} at {{Green|40}} pests. Any pests over this cap remain in the player's vacuum.

=== Pesthunter's Wares ===
'''Pesthunter's Wares''' is a shop accessible through '''Pesthunter Phillip'''. It allows the player to purchase various gear useful when fighting [[Pests]], the shop uses {{Pests}} as a currency.

