&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: There's a &6Pest &fout there somewhere, I'm certain of it.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: When you find one, simply aim the &avacuum&f, hold down the button, and you can suck them buggers up real quick!
