| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: To each their own. I'm fascinated by these little fellers!
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: Bring some back for me to, uh...study...and I'll reward you with &6☘ Farming Fortune for your troubles!
}}
|-
| class="ct" colspan="2" | After emptying Vacuum Bag
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &6Phillip&f: Thanks for the &6Pest&f, [[Player]]!
&e[NPC] &6Phillip&f: In exchange for &6# Pest&f, I've given you &6+#☘ Farming Fortune &ffor &a30m&f!
&e[NPC] &6Phillip&f: Vacuum more Pests and exchange them with me to gain even more &6☘ Farming Fortune&f!
}}
|-
| class="ct" colspan="2" | {{Abiphone Contact}}
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fHowdy, [[Player]]!
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fYer know, standing 'ere all day with nothing to do gets pretty borin' at times.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fIf you want my contact, how about you bring me somethin' to keep me occupied, eh?
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fA &9Squeaky Toy &fwould do the trick.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fYou hearin' me? Bring me one of those and you can have my contact.
&a&l[GIVE ITEM]}}
|-
| class="ct" colspan="2" | Clicking {{rmt|&a&l[GIVE ITEM]}} without a {{Item|Squeaky Toy}}
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fWhat's all this about, eh?
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fQuit yer playin' and bring me a &9Squeaky Toy &for you ain't getting my contact!
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fYou can sometimes find 'em after vacuuming up a &5Field Mouse&f. You can only catch those rare little guys in &9Pest Traps&f.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fI heard somebody 'round here sells them. Oh - it's me!}}
|-
| class="ct" colspan="2" | Clicking {{rmt|&a&l[GIVE ITEM]}} with a {{Item|Squeaky Toy}}
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fCheers mate, that works!
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fTo be honest with ya, though, I have no use for this toy.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fI just ask for it because it gets people buying a bunch of &9Pest Traps &ffrom me in order to go about getting it.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fWaddya call that, a pyramid scheme? Ponzi scheme? I don't know... I just call it bein' me.
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fAnyways, here's that contact you was after.
&b✆ &6Phillip &fhas been added to your Abiphone's contacts!
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fSee ya around, my partner in pesthuntin'!
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &f...
&e[NPC] &6Pesthunter Phillip&f: &b✆ &fDon't tell my wife I said that.}}
|-
